{"asset_key":"ep8/env_story_18311020","episode":"ep8","category":"env_story","story_id":"18311020","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:3:1831102001:1":{"text":"この詐欺師め！人の金を騙し取っておいて、逃げるつもりか！","source_cn":"你这骗子！骗了别人的钱还想跑！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCC260657AEAA06EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1831102002:1":{"text":"商会の建物が崩れたからって、俺が見つけられないと思うなよ！元本も利益も、全部返しやがれ！","source_cn":"别以为你们商会大楼塌了，我就找不到你！快还钱！把我的利...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x81BB6F2F063F663A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1831102003:1":{"text":"誰が詐欺師だ、でたらめ言うんじゃねえ！投資の資金ならあんたが解約したとき、元本も利益もまとめて返しただろうが！","source_cn":"少胡说了，我可没骗你钱！当初是你自愿投资的，你赎回资金...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B13C56C7ED632DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1831102004:1":{"text":"俺はすべて投資契約書の条項に従って処理したまでだ。この通り、あんたらの署名ももらってるんだよ！","source_cn":"一切都是按照投资合同上的条款来的，那合同可是你亲笔签的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x79EB3C49B96A503E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1831102005:1":{"text":"――ふざけないで！私たちが解約したのは九日前。契約書に従うなら、利益はその時点で確定されるはずでしょ！","source_cn":"——胡扯！我们明明是九天前赎回的，按照合同，我的利润当...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7DE039DD46C69C06","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_fem